{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rogue-like dungeon crawler where you play as a disgruntled employee just trying to quit his job - by force. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Underlings!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through a corporate hell, full of hostile co-workers, feral creatures, and everything in between. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gubbins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerup your underling with wacky magical items, and discover fun synergies like homing fire arrows, health leeching spin shots, and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend through the floors of a randomly generated dungeon world, where each run is unique.\u00a0Collect bizarre powerups and endure unhinged trials, before facing the Underlord himself in your final exit interview. It's quittin' time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/extras/1f0f0dab2678426a26935fb54612ec74.avif?t=1759359973\" width=384 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984600?t=1759359973","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984600?t=1759359973","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/6ced12a4d16b8bbef08953c793dea7771400122a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759359973","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984600/6ced12a4d16b8bbef08953c793dea7771400122a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759359973","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfor